  "notice_title": "中央民族大学新闻与传播学院 2026年“英才计划”硕博连读研究生招生实施细则",
  "organization_name": "新闻与传播学院",
  "organization_id": "11079",
  "notice_release_time": "2025-12-14 15:53",
  "notice_create_time": "2025-12-14 15:53",
  "notice_first_time": "2025-12-14 15:53",
